<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns first credit at 28.47 pct.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns first credit at 28.47 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the first of three credits whereby it sought to inject 3.251 billion pesos in the secondary market on Tuesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    1.125 bln  13 days   28.47 pct</p>
<p>1.126 bln  10 days</p>
<p>    1.000 bln   1 day</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
